/gradlew text eol=lf
# gradlew.bat is stored byte-for-byte (CRLF), not normalized. Gradle generates it with CRLF,
# and Dependabot's gradle-wrapper updates commit it as-is, bypassing .gitattributes. With
# `text eol=crlf`, each such update left gradlew.bat showing as modified. CI checks it stays CRLF.
*.bat -text
*.jar binary
